"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">19</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">세 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">~ </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">34</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">세 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">세부 모집 기준 공고문 참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.6pt; text-indent: -14.6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">선발인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 5</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">개팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">팀당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">3~5</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">명으로 구성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.6pt; text-indent: -14.6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">지원내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">해외배낭연수 경비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">항공료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">숙박비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">현지활동비 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">팀당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">800</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">지원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.6pt; text-indent: -14.6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">연수내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴돋움;font-family:한컴돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span sty